  "description": "Bebek is an upbeat, trendy, and yet down-to-earth social restaurant in the heart of Dubai's most sought-after food lovers' location. Promises to unleash bold Turkish flavours with an international cuisine of the most loved delectables, slithering handcrafted beverages, and a mesmerizing ambiance with changeable lights. Bebek is where friends meet to socialize, where a certain sense of familiarity arouses excitement, and where you are free to be who you are and feel like you are a part of the family. At Bebek, we offer memorable quality time for you and your family while enjoying various live entertainment and Dj sessions. We have a dedicated kids' play area monitored with CCTV for safety so you can sit back and relax while you dine. Our facilities are equipped with prayer rooms and complimentary valet parking",
